# Whitelist: nothing enters the build context unless listed here. This keeps .env, data/raw,
# checkpoints, dist, caches, results and .git out of the image by construction. The weights come
# from the GitHub Release (docker/fetch_model.py), not from the build context.
*
!docker/requirements-serve.txt
!docker/fetch_model.py
!src/
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
